f;\"> Associate Editor of <em>IEEE Transactions on Cybernetics</em> </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">（</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">Top, IF: 19.118)</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 4px 0px; line-height: 27px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2021~</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">至今</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\"> Associate Editor of <em>IEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems</em></span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">（</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">Top, IF: 14.255</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">）</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 4px 0px; line-height: 27px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2021~</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">至今</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\"> Associate Editor of <em>IEEE Transactions on Intelligent Transportation Systems</em></span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">（</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">Top, IF: 9.551</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">）</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 4px 0px; line-height: 27px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2020~</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">至今</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\"> Associate Editor of <em>IEEE/CAA Journal of Automatica Sinica</em></span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">（</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">Top, IF: 7.847</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">）</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 4px 0px; line-height: 27px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2020~</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">至今</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\"> IEEE Senior member</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 4px 0px; line-height: 27px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2020~</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">至今</span> <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">中国人工智能学会自然计算与数字智能城市专业委员会</span> <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">副主任委员</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 4px 0px; line-height: 27px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2018~</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">至今</span> <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">中国机器人学术年会组织委员会</span> <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">委员</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 4px 0px; line-height: 27px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2020~</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">至今</span> <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">中国自动化学会共融机器人专委会</span> <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">常务委员</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 4px 0px; line-height: 27px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2014~</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">至今</span> <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">高等教育出版社《机器人科学与技术》丛书</span> <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">编委会委员</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 4px 0px; line-height: 27px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2017~</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">至今</span> <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华