>招生信息</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"a86fab0c1487674a4e19fe3d83b2344e\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"d3cd91273c2e69e335f25ed6a1507893\">           <p style=\"margin: 4px 0px; line-height: 27px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">欢迎机械、自动化、计算机、人工智能等专业背景的同学报考研究生。</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 4px 0px; line-height: 27px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">每年招收博士后</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">1-2</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">名；</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 4px 0px; line-height: 27px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">每年招收博士生</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2-3</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">名；</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 4px 0px; line-height: 27px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">每年招收硕士生</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2-3</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">名。</span></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(71, 85, 98);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3001\"></i><em id=\"3001\" data-more=\"0\">教学成果</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"a6a02785ce37f68bfbd2329a36e96f5d\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"3be2c86a45b0519a8dfb81dc31505f2b\">           <p><span style=\"font-family:times new roman;\"></span></p>           <p style=\"margin-top:4px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0;line-height:27px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\"><strong style=\"text-wrap:wrap;\"><span style=\"font-family:华文中宋;\">一、教改项目</span></strong></span></strong></p>           <p style=\"margin-top:4px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0;line-height:27px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\"></span></strong></p>           <p style=\"margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 29px; text-wrap: wrap; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"\">1.</span><strong><span style=\"font-family:华文中宋;\">黑龙江省高等教育教学改革研究重点项目（本科教育）</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:华文中宋;\">：数智赋能背景下基于“知行合一、三维联动”的机器人创新人才培养改革，</span><span style=\"\">2025.01-2027.12</span><span style=\"font-family:华文中宋;\">，主持</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 29px; text-wrap: wrap; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"\">2.</span><strong><span style=\"font-family:华文中宋;\">中国机械工业教育协会产教融合重点课题</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:华文中宋;\">：</span><span style=\"\">AI</span><span style=\"font-family:华文中宋;\">聚智，产教同频</span><span style=\"\">:</span><span style=\"font-family:华文中宋;\">基于</span><span style=\"\">AI-CBE</span><span style=\"font-family:华文中宋;\">的机器人创新人才培养研究，</span><span style=\"\">2025.01-2026.12</span><span style=\"font-family:华文中宋;\">，主持</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 29px; text-wrap: wrap; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"\">3.</span><strong><span style=\"font-family:华文中宋;\">教育部高等学校自动化类专业教学指导委员会教育教学改革研究课题</span></strong><strong><span style=\"\">: </span></strong><span style=\"font-family:华文中宋;\">基于</span><span style=\"\">AI</span><span style=\"font-family:华文中宋;\">大模型的机器人专业课程教学改革与实践</span><span style=\"\">——</span><span style=\"font-family:华文中宋;\">以《机器人学基础》为例，</span><span style=\"\">2025.01-2026.12</span><span style=\"font-family:华文中宋;\">，主持</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 29px; text-wrap: wrap; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"\">4.</span><strong><span style=\"font-family:华文中宋;\">教育部高等学校自动化类专业教学指导委员会教育教学改革研究课题</span></strong><strong><span style=\"\"> (</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-family:华文中宋;\">控制理论课程群虚拟教研室专项</span></strong><strong><span style=\"\">)</span></strong><span style=\"\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:华文中宋;\">新工科视域下《自动控制原理》新形态教材建设与实践，</span><span style=\"\">2023.01-2024.12</span><span style=\"font-family:华文中宋;\">，主持</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 29px; text-wrap: wrap; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"\">5.</span><strong><span style=\"font-family:华文中宋;\">北京高等教育本科教学改革创新项目</span></strong><span style=\"\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:华文中宋;\">面向智能机器人类创新型人才的五位一体培养方式的研究，</span><span style=\"\">2020.01-2021.12</span><span style=\"font-family:华文中宋;\">，主持</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-top:4px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0;line-height:27px\"><br></p>           <p style=\"margin-top:4px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0;line-height:27px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">二、成果奖<br></span></strong></p>           <p style=\"margin-top:4px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0;line-height:27px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\"></span></strong></p>           <p style=\"margin: 8px 0px; line-height: 29px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">1.CAAI</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">教学成果激励计划二类成果（</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2024</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">，排</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">1</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">）</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 8px 0px; line-height: 29px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">中国石油和化工教育教学优秀成果（研究生）二等奖（</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2024</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">，排</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">1</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">）</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 8px 0px; line-height: 29px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">3.</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">中国自动化学会教育教学成果奖</span> <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">二等奖（</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2022</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">，排</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">1</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">）</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 8px 0px; line-height: 29px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">4.</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">北京市高等教育教学成果奖</span> <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">二等奖（</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2021</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">，排</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">1</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">）</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 8px 0px; line-height: 29px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">5.</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">中国石油和化工教育教学优秀成果</span> <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">特等奖（</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2020</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">，排</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">1</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">）</span></p>           <p style=\"margin-top:4px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0;line-height:24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:华文中宋;\"><br></span></strong></p>           <p style=\"margin-top:4px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0;line-height:24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:华文中宋;\">三、教改论文</span></strong><br></p>           <p style=\"margin-top:4px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0;line-height:27px\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\"></span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 8px 0px; line-height: 29px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">曹政才</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">林诚然</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">居仁杰</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">“一轴两翼三驱动”的教材建设新模式探索——以《自动控制原理》为例</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">《电气电子教学学报》</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">接收</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">.</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 8px 0px; line-height: 29px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">周萌</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">曹政才</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">*, </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">吴启迪</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">新工科背景下基于</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">“</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">五位一体</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">”</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">的机器人技术教学改革研究</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">《高等工程教育研究》</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">, 2020, 5: 66-70.</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 8px 0px; line-height: 29px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">周萌</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">曹政才</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">*, </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">基于虚拟仿真平台的科教融合拔尖创新人才培养方案探索</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">—</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">以机器人控制技术为例</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">,</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">《高等工程教育研究》</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">, 2020, 6: 62-66.</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 4px 0px; line-height: 27px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\"><br></span></p>           <p style=\"margin-top:4px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:4px;margin-left:0;line-height:27px\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold; font-family:华文中宋;\">四、教材</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 4px 0px; line-height: 27px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\"></span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 8px 0px; line-height: 29px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">《自动控制原理》入选黑龙江省“十四五”规划教材（</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2024</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">）</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 8px 0px; line-height: 29px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">《自动控制原理》获评北京高校“优质本科教材”（</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2023</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">）</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 8px 0px; line-height: 29px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">主编《自动控制原理》，高等工程教育出版社（</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2022</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">）</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 8px 0px; line-height: 29px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">主讲《自动控制原理》获北京高校“优质本科课程”（</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2021</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">）</span></p>           <p><span style=\"font-family:times new roman;\"></span><br></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(71, 85, 98);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3001\"></i><em id=\"3001\" data-more=\"0\">教师荣誉</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"a8e05eb3cb6073618dec44d26b1372ea\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"a5dafae907d7344d737f3dc003a0a27e\">           <p><span style=\"font-family:times new roman;\"></span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 8px 0px; line-height: 29px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2024 </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">第八届全国兵棋推演大赛人机协同赛</span> <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">全国一等奖</span> <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">指导教师</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 8px 0px; line-height: 29px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2024 </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">第八届全国兵棋推演大赛人机协同赛</span> <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">优秀算法奖</span> <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">指导教师</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 8px 0px; line-height: 29px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2024 </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">第七届中国研究生机器人创新设计大赛</span> <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">全国一等奖</span> <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">指导教师</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 8px 0px; line-height: 29px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2023 </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">第七届全国兵棋推演大赛人机协同赛</span> <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">全国总冠军</span> <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">指导教师</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 8px 0px; line-height: 29px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2023 </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">第六届中国研究生机器人创新设计大赛</span> <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">全国总亚军</span> <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">指导教师</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 8px 0px; line-height: 29px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2022 </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">北京市高校研究生课程思政示范课程</span> <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">教学名师</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 8px 0px; line-height: 29px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2022 </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">北京市高校研究生课程思政示范课程</span> <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">教学团队负责人</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 8px 0px; line-height: 29px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2022 </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">北京高校研究生课程思政示范课程</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">:</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">《机器人控制技术》</span> <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">负责人</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 8px 0px; line-height: 29px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2022 </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">北京高校优秀本科育人团队</span> <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">主要负责人（排序第</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">）</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 8px 0px; line-height: 29px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2021 </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">北京高等学校优秀专业课</span> <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">主讲教师</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 8px 0px; line-height: 29px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2021 </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">北京高校</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">“</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">优质本科课程</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">”:</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">《自动控制原理》</span> <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">负责人</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 8px 0px; line-height: 29px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2021 </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">北京市优秀本科毕业设计</span> <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">优秀指导教师</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 8px 0px; line-height: 29px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2021 </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">第一届新工科本科毕业设计大赛</span> <span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">优秀指导教师</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 8px 0px; line-height: 29px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2022 </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">北京化工大学优秀研究生指导教师</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 8px 0px; line-height: 29px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2020 </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">北京化工大学研究生</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">“</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">立德树人</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">”</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">德育导师</span></p>           <p style=\"margin: 8px 0px; line-height: 29px; text-indent: 2em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2020 </span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:华文中宋;\">北京化工大学优秀教师</span></p>           <p><span style=\"font-family:times new roman;\"><br></span><br></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>     </ul>     </div>     <div id=\"d1778d9196935cc6129d6ebeee257370part\" class=\"part_box\" style=\"display: none;\">      <ul class=\"tacherContent_parts\" id=\"tacherContent_parts\" style=\"\">      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(71, 85, 98);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3001\"></i><em id=\"3001\" data-more=\"0\">Basic information</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"top\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"up\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"down\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"bottom\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"delete\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"fd577bbf6e37d860dd690d97bc018b7e\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           title          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"4aaa89d42cfe9d76370fd91807dc81e6\">           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman;\"> Cao Zhengcai, Ph. D., Professor in the School of Mechatronics Engineering, Harbin Institute of Technology, recognized through several prestigious appointments including Leading Scientific Talent of Beijing (2019). He is also honored as a Beijing Higher Education Curriculum Ideology and Politics Teaching Master (2022) and leads the corresponding teaching team, with his group further selected as Heilongjiang Province's Graduate Advisor-Student Ideology and Politics Team (2025).<br> His research focuses on intelligent robotics and artificial intelligence, leading over 10 major projects in the past five years, including key initiatives under the NSFC Major Research Plan, National Key R&amp;D Program, and Beijing Natural Science Foundation. With 30+ IEEE Transactions papers as first/corresponding author, 20+ Chinese invention patents, and 10+ software copyrights, his contributions have earned him the Natural Science Award (2nd Class, Ministry of Education, 2022), Natural Science Award (1st Class, Chinese Association of Automation, 2020), and Technical Invention Award (2nd Class, China Machinery Industry, 2022)—all as first-ranked recipient.<br> In teaching, he has directed 5 pedagogical reform projects, including provincial and industry key initiatives. His course Principles of Automatic Control is designated a Beijing High-Quality Undergraduate Course, while Robot Control Technology is listed in MoE’s \"Tuojin Plan\" and as a Beijing Curriculum Ideology and Politics Model Course. His textbook Principles of Automatic Control is selected for Heilongjiang’s 14th Five-Year Plan and Beijing High-Quality Undergraduate Textbook. His educational accolades span the Special Prize (China Petroleum &amp; Chemical Education, 2020), two 2nd Prizes (Beijing Higher Education, 2021; CAA, 2022), a Type II Achievement (CAAI Teaching Incentive, 2024), and another 2nd Prize for graduate education (2024), all as lead contributor.</span></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(71, 85, 98);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3001\"></i><em id=\"3001\" data-more=\"0\">Professional Experience</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"top\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"up\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"down\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"bottom\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"delete\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"5a75defaadf9e01ed2172214d7a93a6c\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           title          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"c3705e6bb11f24b6331292ffba65064b\">           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman;\">—Professor, School of Mechanical and Electrical Engineering, Harbin Institute of Technology, 2024.02–Present<br> —Deputy Director, Science and Technology Development Research Institute, Beijing University of Chemical Technology, 2020.05–2023.11<br> —Deputy Dean, College of Information Science and Technology, Beijing University of Chemical Technology, 2015.09–2020.09<br> —Visiting Scholar, King’s College London, UK, 2014.03–2015.03<br> —Associate Professor / Professor, Beijing University of Chemical Technology, 2008.07–2024.01<br> —Postdoctoral Researcher, Tongji University, 2005.12–2008.07</span></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(71, 85, 98);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3001\"></i><em id=\"3001\" data-more=\"0\">Research Interests</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"top\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"up\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"down\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"bottom\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"delete\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"0b4b703bc96c9cb8497723040de73cfb\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           title          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"d00d0d71170baa1dde4db332d94039ec\">           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman;\">—Artificial Intelligence Algorithms<br> —Embodied Intelligence in Robotics<br> —Humanoid Robots</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman;\"></span><br></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(